Subject: Re: [poppr] Is the "threshold" a fixed argument or an upper limit in a "threshold" series in the mlg.filter() ?
Message-ID: <9cMEt5BN9dQ.WdA6KA3gAQAJ@poppr.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <9cMEt5BN9dQ.dcgP1IjODgAJ@poppr.groups.google.com>
